--TEST--
a cursor on a field of an attribute's declaration answers the field and every key that names it in a payload, and not a key of another attribute with the same name, `rule:attributes/an-attribute-is-declared-with-its-sites`, `rule:ide/five-features-are-one-reference-index`
--FILE--
<?nvs
attribute Index on class { col<|>umns: string }
attribute Unique on class { columns: string }

#[Index(columns: "email")]
#[Unique(columns: "email")]
class Order {}

#[Index(columns: "name")]
class Customer {}
--REQUEST--
references
--EXPECT--
case.nvs:2:28
case.nvs:5:9
case.nvs:9:9
